<title>SWITZERLAND: Roche to publish 9-month results Oct 15.</title>
<headline>Roche to publish 9-month results Oct 15.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roche Holding AG said it would release group sales figures for the first nine months of 1996 on Tuesday, October 15.</p>
<p>It said the figures would be published &quot;before the opening of the Swiss Stock Exchange&quot;. Exchange trading opens at 10:00 a.m. (0800 GMT).  </p>
<p>In 1995, Roche posted a two percent rise in nine-month sales to 11,006 million Swiss francs from 10,739 million the year before.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom, +41-1-631 7340</p>
